          "message": "chore(velvet): release v3.0.0 (#1624)\n\nNo issue: the 3.0.0 release.\n\nCloses `## [Unreleased]` as `## [3.0.0] - 2026-11-14`: the changelog fragments are folded into the file, the\nentries of `## [Unreleased — breaking]` are drained into the version with that heading left standing over\nnothing, the version carries a fresh Highlights block, and `package.json` is at 3.0.0. No open pull request\nadds to `## [Unreleased — breaking]`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
