          "id": "51125fe5a84e939885b8c3c634a0b1cfd8f46992",
          "message": "chore(velvet): release v3.0.2 (#1794)\n\nNo issue: the 3.0.2 release.\n\nVelvet 3.0.2 is a patch release of fixes and internal refinements: ring bands, FocusScope autoFocus, host recovery after a UIDocument is re-enabled, Tailwind parity for shadows and colour brackets, transition curves, UseQueries combine, USS importer values, and pooled-element reset.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
